title: "Site-specific N-glycoproteomic analysis of extracellular vesicles from seminal plasma reveals the molecular typing of azoospermia"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-14
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - given-names: "Xuejiang"
    family-names: "Guo"
